    overview:
      "Multi-award winning choreographer Supple Nam was given another irresistible video treatment screaming award by genius mastermind director Ninian Doff.\nExcited about making another great project, Supple and Ninian worked very closely, discussing ideas for casting and choreography. Supple's intuition was to go with the unexpected approach on choreography and casting, even though the script was leaning towards musical theatre professional dancers/actors to be cast. Instead Supple went for actors with passion for dance `dance enthusiast`. Ninian, trusting Supple's professional approach and experience, the cast was selected.\n After auditioning all the applicants, Supple studied the audition videos and configured a catered dance routine to best fit and challenge the chosen actors to their optimum.\n Both the actors, knowing Supple’s reputation, understood the value of creating something great. Rehearsing the dance routine in 2 half days to support the budget and without an assistant. Supple met all the background artists (non dancers) on the morning of the shoot to teach them movement direction and simple choreography. \nStepping into the location, Supple altered the choreography to work with the environment of the set. He Set up each scene in the vane of a stage musical for the camera.  \nSince the release, the video generated a strong following, where fans have reached out to both Ninian and Supple asking for back stories, potential sequel ideas and tips on learning the choreography. The surprise has pleased management and the record label.",
